<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <title>TOP8 順位シミュレーター [スマホ版]</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #090d16;
      --card: #151d2e;
      --card-inner: #0f172a;
      --border: #223049;
      --text: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --primary: #3b82f6;
      --primary-active: #2563eb;
      --success: #10b981;
      --success-bg: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
      --warning: #f59e0b;
      --warning-bg: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
      --danger: #ef4444;
      --danger-bg: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
      --waseda: #fb7185;
      --waseda-bg: rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.15);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.4;
      padding-bottom: 74px; /* space for bottom nav */
    }

    /* Sticky Top Bar for Waseda Status */
    .waseda-sticky-bar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 40;
      background: rgba(21, 29, 46, 0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 10px 14px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 2px 7px;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 6px;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .badge-in { background: var(--success-bg); color: #34d399; border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); }
    .badge-tie { background: var(--warning-bg); color: #fbbf24; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3); }
    .badge-out { background: var(--danger-bg); color: #f87171; border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3); }
    .badge-blue { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2); color: #60a5fa; border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3); }

    /* Bottom Navigation Bar */
    .bottom-nav {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 60px;
      background: #0f172a;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-around;
      align-items: center;
      z-index: 50;
      box-shadow: 0 -4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
    .nav-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      background: none;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      width: 33.3%;
      height: 100%;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-item.active {
      color: #38bdf8;
    }
    .nav-icon { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 2px; }

    /* Content Area */
    .content-area {
      padding: 12px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Section Card */
    .section-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    /* Preset Horizontal Scroll */
    .preset-scroll {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding-bottom: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    .preset-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .btn-pill {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--card-inner);
      color: var(--text);
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-pill:active { background: var(--border); }
    .btn-pill.green { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); color: #34d399; border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); }
    .btn-pill.amber { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color: #fbbf24; border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3); }
    .btn-pill.red { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); color: #f87171; border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3); }

    /* Match Card - Mobile Optimized */
    .m-card {
      background: var(--card-inner);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .m-card.is-locked {
      border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.6);
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05);
    }
    .m-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .btn-lock {
      padding: 3px 8px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--card);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-lock.locked {
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
      color: #34d399;
      border-color: #10b981;
    }
    .btn-m-clear {
      padding: 2px 6px;
      font-size: 10px;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      border-radius: 4px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .m-body {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .m-team-btn {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 44px; /* Apple minimum touch target */
      padding: 6px 4px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--card);
      color: var(--text);
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: center;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: all 0.15s;
    }
    .m-team-btn.winner {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      border-color: var(--primary-active);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
    }
    .m-score-box {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .m-score-input {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      color: var(--text);
      inputmode: numeric;
    }
    .m-score-input:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: var(--primary);
    }

    /* Standings Table for Mobile */
    .standings-item {
      background: var(--card-inner);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .standings-item.po-team {
      border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05);
    }
    .standings-item.waseda-team {
      border-left: 4px solid #fb7185;
      background: rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.08);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .rank-num {
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .rank-num.po { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); color: #34d399; }

    /* Alert callout */
    .callout {
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* 256 Pattern Card with Drilldown */
    .pattern-card {
      background: var(--card-inner);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .pattern-card.expanded {
      border-color: #3b82f6;
      background: #101726;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
    .pattern-header {
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .pattern-details-panel {
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding-top: 10px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: none;
    }
    .pattern-card.expanded .pattern-details-panel {
      display: block;
      animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease-out;
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .detail-rank-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      background: rgba(21, 29, 46, 0.6);
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    .detail-rank-row.po {
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
      border-left: 3px solid #10b981;
    }
    .detail-rank-row.waseda {
      background: rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.12);
      border-left: 3px solid #fb7185;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .btn-apply-pattern {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 9px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: none;
      background: #2563eb;
      color: #fff;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .btn-apply-pattern:active { background: #1d4ed8; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Sticky Top Waseda Status Bar -->
  <div class="waseda-sticky-bar">
    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;">
      <span style="font-size:16px;">🏈</span>
      <div>
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;">
          <strong style="font-size:13px; color:#fb7185;">早稲田大</strong>
          <span id="waseda-status-badge" class="badge badge-blue">暫定 3位</span>
        </div>
        <span id="waseda-score-text" style="font-size:10px; color:var(--text-muted);">4勝 1敗 (残り2試合)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:right;">
      <span id="waseda-verdict-title" style="font-size:11px; font-weight:800; color:#34d399; display:block;">進出判定中</span>
      <span id="unplayed-count-text" style="font-size:10px; color:var(--text-muted);">未設定 8 試合</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-area">

    <!-- ============================================== -->
    <!-- TAB 1: SIMULATOR (MOBILE)                      -->
    <!-- ============================================== -->
    <div id="tab-sim">

      <!-- Presets Scroll -->
      <div style="margin-bottom:10px;">
        <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; color:var(--text-muted); margin-bottom:6px;">⚡ クイックシナリオ:</div>
        <div class="preset-scroll">
          <button class="btn-pill green" onclick="applyPreset('waseda_2win')">早稲田2連勝 (100%進出)</button>
          <button class="btn-pill amber" onclick="applyPreset('tie_5wins')">5勝三つ巴(早稲田・立教・中央)</button>
          <button class="btn-pill amber" onclick="applyPreset('tie_4wins')">4勝三つ巴(早稲田・明治・中央)</button>
          <button class="btn-pill red" onclick="applyPreset('waseda_out')">早稲田 敗退確定ケース</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Action Row -->
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:12px; background:var(--card); padding:8px 12px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--border);">
        <label style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer;">
          <input type="checkbox" id="toggle-score-mode" onchange="toggleScoreMode()" style="width:16px; height:16px; accent-color:var(--primary);">
          <span>得点を計算に反映</span>
        </label>
        <button onclick="clearAllMatches()" style="padding:4px 8px; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid var(--border); background:rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); color:#f87171; cursor:pointer;">
          🔄 クリア (✅保護)
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Matches Container -->
      <div style="margin-bottom:16px;">
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;">
          <h2 style="font-size:14px; font-weight:800;">残り8試合 (第6節・第7節)</h2>
          <span id="pattern-num-badge" class="badge badge-blue">全256通り</span>
        </div>
        <div id="matches-list-container">
          <!-- Rendered via JS -->
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Standings Section -->
      <div class="section-card">
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom:6px;">
          <h3 style="font-size:14px; font-weight:800; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;">
            リアルタイム順位表
            <span class="badge badge-in">上位3校プレーオフ</span>
          </h3>
          <span style="font-size:10px; color:var(--text-muted);">勝点＞勝数＞直接対決</span>
        </div>

        <div id="standings-mobile-list">
          <!-- Rendered via JS -->
        </div>

        <div id="tiebreak-alert-panel" class="callout" style="display:none;">
          <!-- Rendered via JS -->
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- ============================================== -->
    <!-- TAB 2: PATTERNS LIST (MOBILE)                  -->
    <!-- ============================================== -->
    <div id="tab-table" style="display:none;">
      <div class="section-card">
        <div style="margin-bottom:10px;">
          <h2 style="font-size:15px; font-weight:800; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;">
            <span>全256通り 一覧・詳細</span>
            <span id="pattern-filter-badge" class="badge badge-blue">256 パターン</span>
          </h2>
          <p id="pattern-filter-desc" style="font-size:11px; color:var(--text-muted); margin-top:4px;">
            カードをタップすると<strong>1〜8位の全順位・タイブレーク理由</strong>が詳しく展開されます。
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Filter pills -->
        <div style="display:flex; gap:6px; overflow-x:auto; padding-bottom:6px; margin-bottom:10px;">
          <button class="btn-pill" onclick="filterPatterns('all')">全て (<span id="cnt-all">256</span>)</button>
          <button class="btn-pill green" onclick="filterPatterns('進出確定')">進出確定 (<span id="cnt-in">200</span>)</button>
          <button class="btn-pill amber" onclick="filterPatterns('未確定')">未確定 (<span id="cnt-tie">28</span>)</button>
          <button class="btn-pill red" onclick="filterPatterns('敗退確定')">敗退確定 (<span id="cnt-out">28</span>)</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Pattern cards list -->
        <div id="patterns-mobile-container" style="max-height:72vh; overflow-y:auto;">
          <!-- Rendered via JS -->
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================== -->
    <!-- TAB 3: REPORT (MOBILE)                         -->
    <!-- ============================================== -->
    <div id="tab-report" style="display:none;">
      <div class="section-card" style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.6;">
        <h2 style="font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:6px;">早稲田プレーオフ進出条件の徹底解説</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted); margin-bottom:14px;">
          第5節終了時点（10/18終了）から全256通りの展開をシミュレーションしたまとめです。
        </p>

        <div style="background:rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); border:1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); border-radius:10px; padding:10px 12px; margin-bottom:10px;">
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-weight:800; color:#34d399;">
            <span>① 早稲田が2連勝（6勝1敗）</span>
            <span>100% 進出！</span>
          </div>
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted); font-size:11px; margin-top:4px;">
            全64通りすべて進出確定。法政・立教と6勝1敗で3校が並ぶ三つ巴になっても、3校全員が3位以内となるため他校に関係なく自力進出確定。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background:rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1); border:1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3); border-radius:10px; padding:10px 12px; margin-bottom:10px;">
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-weight:800; color:#60a5fa;">
            <span>② 早稲田が1勝1敗（5勝2敗）</span>
            <span>90.6%〜100%</span>
          </div>
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted); font-size:11px; margin-top:4px;">
            128通り中116通りで進出確定。敗退確定は0通り！未確定の12通りは「早稲田・立教・中央」の5勝三つ巴（2〜4位争い、立教vs中央の得失点次第）。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background:rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1); border:1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3); border-radius:10px; padding:10px 12px; margin-bottom:14px;">
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-weight:800; color:#fbbf24;">
            <span>③ 早稲田が2連敗（4勝3敗）</span>
            <span>31.3%〜56.3%</span>
          </div>
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted); font-size:11px; margin-top:4px;">
            64通り中20通りで進出、16通りが未確定（早稲田・明治・中央の4勝三つ巴）、28通りで敗退。連敗でも約3割は他力で3位滑り込み可能！
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border); padding-top:10px;">
          <h3 style="font-size:13px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:6px;">第5節終了時点の順位</h3>
          <div style="font-size:11px; color:var(--text-muted); line-height:1.7;">
            1位: 法政 (5-0)<br>
            2位: 立教 (4-1) ※直接対決勝<br>
            3位: 早稲田 (4-1)<br>
            4位: 中央 (3-2)<br>
            5位: 明治 (2-3)<br>
            6位: 慶應 (1-4)<br>
            7位: 東大 (1-4)<br>
            8位: 日体 (0-5)
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Navigation Bar -->
  <nav class="bottom-nav">
    <button id="nav-btn-sim" class="nav-item active" onclick="switchTab('sim')">
      <span class="nav-icon">⚡</span>
      <span>シミュレータ</span>
    </button>
    <button id="nav-btn-table" class="nav-item" onclick="switchTab('table')">
      <span class="nav-icon">📋</span>
      <span>256パターン</span>
    </button>
    <button id="nav-btn-report" class="nav-item" onclick="switchTab('report')">
      <span class="nav-icon">📊</span>
      <span>分析レポート</span>
    </button>
  </nav>

